  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Love, Care. Educate and Empower 40 Girls in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project  provides a safe shelter home and nurturing environment for girls who have been abandoned , trafficked, abused or neglected by their families or society.  Provide  Education, healthcare,  counseling, life skills  and vocational training for the girls, helping them to develop their skills and become self-reliant and confident members of society. Support and sponsor  girls to complete from their formal high school  education to professional Graduation courses to secure employment</narrative>
  </description>
